      "name": "孔雀重飞",
      "priority": 1,
      "hidden": true,
      "condition": { "events": [], "anyEvents": [], "scenes": ["S12"], "anyScenes": [], "characters": [], "anyCharacters": [], "marks": ["oath", "refusedPower", "villagerSupport"], "flags": [], "forbiddenFlags": ["lanzhiDead", "zhongqingDead"], "minScore": 90, "minCulture": 0 },
      "text": "玩家在孔雀台重新排列关键事件，使双鸟不再只是死后的象征，而成为主动飞向自由的意象。该结局是完成经典线后获得的想象性补偿。"
    },
    {
      "id": "independence",
      "name": "兰芝新生——独立选择",
      "priority": 2,
      "hidden": false,
      "condition": { "events": ["E19", "E21"], "anyEvents": [], "scenes": [], "anyScenes": [], "characters": [], "anyCharacters": [], "marks": [], "flags": [], "forbiddenFlags": ["lanzhiDead"], "minScore": 0, "minCulture": 0 },
      "text": "这一次，兰芝不再让别人替她决定命运。她带着织机离开故乡，以自己的双手开始新的生活。她的价值，不再由任何一场婚姻定义。"
    },
    {
      "id": "reconcile",
      "name": "破礼重圆——家庭和解",
      "priority": 3,
      "hidden": false,
      "condition": { "events": ["E18"], "anyEvents": ["E16", "E20"], "scenes": [], "anyScenes": [], "characters": [], "anyCharacters": [], "marks": [], "flags": [], "forbiddenFlags": ["lanzhiDead", "zhongqingDead"], "minScore": 0, "minCulture": 0 },
      "text": "焦母终于明白，家族的体面不应建立在拆散有情人之上。堂前旧规未曾一夜消失，但这个家庭第一次愿意倾听兰芝的声音。"
    },
    {
      "id": "flee",
      "name": "磐石蒲苇——远走自由",
      "priority": 4,
      "hidden": false,
      "condition": { "events": ["E06", "E17"], "anyEvents": [], "scenes": [], "anyScenes": [], "characters": ["C01", "C02"], "anyCharacters": [], "marks": [], "flags": [], "forbiddenFlags": ["lanzhiDead", "zhongqingDead", "motherAwakened"], "minScore": 0, "minCulture": 0 },
      "text": "他们没有等到所有人的理解，却终于能够依照自己的心意共同生活。故乡渐远，誓言仍在：蒲苇纫如丝，磐石无转移。"
    },
    {
      "id": "classic",
      "name": "孔雀东南飞——经典悲剧",
      "priority": 5,
      "hidden": false,
      "condition": { "events": ["E04", "E12", "E13"], "anyEvents": ["E09", "E10"], "scenes": [], "anyScenes": [], "characters": [], "anyCharacters": [], "marks": [], "flags": [], "forbiddenFlags": [], "minScore": 0, "minCulture": 10 },
      "text": "孔雀东南飞，五里一徘徊。二人的生命虽然消逝，忠贞的爱情却化作永不分离的双鸟。后人记住这场悲剧，也记住了被礼教阻隔的真心。"
    },
    {
      "id": "wealth",
      "name": "富贵空梦——逻辑成立但偏离主题",
      "priority": 6,
      "hidden": false,
